<p>
Gracious God,
</p>

<p>
I resolve<br>
to laugh,<br>
to listen,<br>
and to love<br>
like one whose<br>
eyes have just<br>
been opened in<br>
joy and wonder.
</p>

<p>
In the name of<br>
the one who<br>
makes wine from water<br>
and beauty from ashes,
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


